# A fixture-owned seed for the content-key exclusion declaration. run.sh copies it to <probe>/scripts/suite-content-key.sh,
# where the hook's readset_excluded_re reads the span between EXCLUDE_BEGIN and EXCLUDE_END. It stands in for the
# repository's own scripts/suite-content-key.sh, which a consumer does not carry and a declared fixture cannot name
# there. Arms G and J assert that a declared directory under an excluded top (docs) yields no key rows.
# EXCLUDE_BEGIN
EXCLUDE="
.git
CHANGELOG.md
VERSION
docs
CLAUDE.md
"
# EXCLUDE_END
